        },
        "chapterId": "2JN.1",
        "content": "Me, Asɔre Panin,\n    \n    Meretwerɛ akɔma Awuraa a wɔayi no ne ne mma a medɔ wɔn, nokorɛ no enti. Ɛnyɛ me nko, na mmom, wɔn a wɔnim nokorɛ no nyinaa dɔ mo,",
        "reference": "2 Yohane 1:1",
        "verseNumber": "1",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b59109531092a820c56d4a",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "2JN.1.2",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "2JN",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bd57999137613db5cb6",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
