            "id": "2JN.1",
            "number": "1",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bd57999137613db5bf7"
        },
        "chapterId": "2JN.1",
        "content": "ɛfiri sɛ, nokorɛ no te yɛn mu na ɛbɛtena yɛn mu akɔsi daa:",
        "reference": "2 Yohane 1:2",
        "verseNumber": "2",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b5910a531092a820c56d72",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "2JN.1.3",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "2JN",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bd57999137613db5cb6",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "2JN",
            "id": "2JN.1",
            "number": "1",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bd57999137613db5bf7"
        },
        "chapterId": "2JN.1",
        "content": "Adom, mmɔborɔhunu ne asomdwoeɛ mfiri Agya Onyankopɔn ne Awurade Yesu Kristo, Agya no Ba no nkyɛn, mmra yɛn so nokorɛ ne ɔdɔ mu.",
        "reference": "2 Yohane 1:3",
        "verseNumber": "3",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b5910a531092a820c56dfb",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "2JN.1.4",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "2JN",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bd57999137613db5cb6",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "2JN",
            "id": "2JN.1",
            "number": "1",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bd57999137613db5bf7"
        },
        "chapterId": "2JN.1",
        "content": "Mʼani gyee sɛ mehunuu sɛ mo mma no bi te nokorɛ mu sɛdeɛ Agya no hyɛɛ yɛn no.",
        "reference": "2 Yohane 1:4",
        "verseNumber": "4",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b5910a531092a820c56e57",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "2JN.1.5",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "2JN",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bd57999137613db5cb6",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "2JN",
            "id": "2JN.1",
            "number": "1",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bd57999137613db5bf7"
        },
        "chapterId": "2JN.1",
        "content": "Enti, mereka akyerɛ wo, Awuraa sɛ, momma yɛnnodɔ yɛn ho. Yei nyɛ mmara foforɔ a merehyɛ ama wo. Ɛyɛ mmara a wɔahyɛ ama yɛn firi ahyɛaseɛ.",
        "reference": "2 Yohane 1:5",
        "verseNumber": "5",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b5910a531092a820c56eac",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "2JN.1.6",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "2JN",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bd57999137613db5cb6",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "2JN",
            "id": "2JN.1",
            "number": "1",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bd57999137613db5bf7"
        },
        "chapterId": "2JN.1",
        "content": "Saa ɔdɔ a mereka ho asɛm yi kyerɛ sɛ, momma yɛntena ase na yɛnyɛ ɔsetie mma Onyankopɔn. Mmara a mote firii ahyɛaseɛ no kyerɛ sɛ mo nyinaa, montena ase ɔdɔ mu.",
        "reference": "2 Yohane 1:6",
        "verseNumber": "6",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b5910a531092a820c56eff",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "2JN.1.7",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "2JN",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bd57999137613db5cb6",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "2JN",
            "id": "2JN.1",
            "number": "1",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bd57999137613db5bf7"
        },
        "chapterId": "2JN.1",
        "content": "Adaadaafoɔ a wɔnnnye nntom sɛ Yesu Kristo baa ɔhonam mu no abɔ apete ewiase. Saa adaadaafoɔ yi yɛ atorofoɔ ne Kristo atamfoɔ.",
        "reference": "2 Yohane 1:7",
        "verseNumber": "7",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b5910a531092a820c56f18",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "2JN.1.8",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "2JN",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bd57999137613db5cb6",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "2JN",
            "id": "2JN.1",
            "number": "1",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bd57999137613db5bf7"
        },
        "chapterId": "2JN.1",
        "content": "Monhwɛ mo ho so yie na moanhwere deɛ moayɛ ho adwuma na moanya mo akatua wɔ mu no.",
        "reference": "2 Yohane 1:8",
        "verseNumber": "8",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b5910a531092a820c56f5b",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "2JN.1.9",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "2JN",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bd57999137613db5cb6",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "2JN",
            "id": "2JN.1",
            "number": "1",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bd57999137613db5bf7"
        },
        "chapterId": "2JN.1",
        "content": "Obiara a ɔntena Kristo nkyerɛkyerɛ mu no, ɔnni Onyankopɔn. Na deɛ ɔtena nkyerɛkyerɛ no mu no wɔ Agya no ne Ɔba no.",
        "reference": "2 Yohane 1:9",
        "verseNumber": "9",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b5910a531092a820c56f88",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "2JN.1.10",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "2JN",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bd57999137613db5cb6",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "2JN",
            "id": "2JN.1",
            "number": "1",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bd57999137613db5bf7"
        },
        "chapterId": "2JN.1",
        "content": "Sɛ obi ba mo nkyɛn na wamfa saa nkyerɛkyerɛ yi ammrɛ mo a, monnnye no wɔ mo efie, na monnnye nʼani nso.",
        "reference": "2 Yohane 1:10",
        "verseNumber": "10",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b5910a531092a820c56f97",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "2JN.1.11",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "2JN",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bd57999137613db5cb6",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "2JN",
            "id": "2JN.1",
            "number": "1",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bd57999137613db5bf7"
        },
        "chapterId": "2JN.1",
        "content": "Ɛfiri sɛ, obiara a ɔgye saa onipa no ka bɔne a ɔyɛ no ho.",
        "reference": "2 Yohane 1:11",
        "verseNumber": "11",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b5910a531092a820c56fc7",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "2JN.1.12",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "2JN",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bd57999137613db5cb6",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "2JN",
            "id": "2JN.1",
            "number": "1",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bd57999137613db5bf7"
        },
        "chapterId": "2JN.1",
        "content": "Mewɔ nsɛm pii ka kyerɛ mo, nanso meremfa krataa ne twerɛduro so nka. Na mmom, mɛba onipadua so abɛkasa akyerɛ mo, na mo ani agye.",
        "reference": "2 Yohane 1:12",
        "verseNumber": "12",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b5910a531092a820c56fd5",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "2JN.1.13",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "2JN",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bd57999137613db5cb6",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "2JN",
            "id": "2JN.1",
            "number": "1",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bd57999137613db5bf7"
        },
        "chapterId": "2JN.1",
        "content": "Wo nuabaa a wɔayi no no mma no kyea wo.",
        "reference": "2 Yohane 1:13",
        "verseNumber": "13",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    }
]